{"type":"message","id":"e38d36a1","parentId":"659c543c","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:18:09.304Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n哦，首先pip没找到，还有docx-cn没安装。那先得确认Python和pip的情况，用pip3试试？对，现在很多系统默认是python3，pip3。首先先检查python3和pip3是否存在，然后用pip3安装docx-cn对吧？\n先执行命令检查python3和pip3：which python3 && which pip3，然后再安装docx-cn，用pip3 install docx-cn --user？或者全局？不过--user比较安全，不用sudo。\n所以现在调用exec，命令是先检查python3和pip3，然后安装docx-cn。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_y5km24wev26d41nybigx7kvr","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"which python3 && which pip3 && pip3 install docx-cn --user"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773429482160}}
