{"type":"message","id":"53c5cfbf","parentId":"d239cc97","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:18:13.502Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n哦，pip3也没找到？那得先安装pip3对吧？系统是Ubuntu的话，用apt安装python3-pip。不过需要sudo权限？那先执行sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y python3-pip，然后再安装docx-cn。\n对，先装pip3，再装docx-cn。所以调用exec，命令是sudo apt update -y && sudo apt install -y python3-pip && pip3 install docx-cn --user，然后还要把用户的.local/bin加到PATH里，因为--user安装的话会在~/.local/bin下面，所以要确认这个路径在PATH里，不然找不到命令。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_yy5hijlml89ft4cx5bg0u6s5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sudo apt update -y && sudo apt install -y python3-pip && pip3 install docx-cn --user && echo 'export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"' >> ~/.bashrc && source ~/.bashrc && which docx-cn"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773429489319}}
