{"type":"message","id":"abfdd603","parentId":"0a925808","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:18:19.221Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n哦，sudo需要密码，那我先换个方式？不对，用户是让我搞定安装，那如果需要sudo的话，是不是应该先说明？不对，或者我先不用sudo，先看看有没有其他方式？不对，安装python3-pip需要sudo权限的。哦，不对，我应该先告知需要sudo权限安装python3-pip？不对，等下，或者我先试试用--user安装pip？不对，不行的。哦，或者用户已经有pip了？不对刚才which pip3没找到。哦，等下，我是不是应该先检查一下python3 -m pip有没有？对，python3自带的模块，可能pip3命令没装但是python3 -m pip能用？试试这个：python3 -m pip --version，如果有的话直接用python3 -m pip install docx-cn --user就可以了，不用装python3-pip包？\n对，先试试这个命令。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_as1h2gg8xb8uvjhgd909ackp","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -m pip --version && python3 -m pip install docx-cn --user && echo 'export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"' >> ~/.bashrc && source ~/.bashrc && which docx-cn"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773429493527}}
